From: PixOS-Project contributors
Subject: [PATCH 0008] sweetgl: GL_APPLE_fence over sync objects, CA-format texture upload, suffix lookup, slot-trap arguments

PixOS G6 (run g6-b, docs/research/52 s.13). On top of 0001-0007.
- gli: glGen/Delete/Set/Is/Test/FinishFenceAPPLE over ES 3 sync objects (sweetgl_fence.h, Khronos APPLE_fence);
  Test/FinishObjectAPPLE(GL_FENCE_APPLE) forward to them; glMultiTexCoord4f log-once no-op; lookup appends ARB/EXT
  (glVertexAttrib{1..4}f[v] -> *ARB, glVertexAttribI4i -> *EXT); slot traps log x1..x4 once.
- eagl: sampled surfaces without a known fourcc are uploaded with CA's (internalFormat, format, type) checked against
  bytes per element (sgl_upload_params); fmt 0x0 bpe-4 render targets use the BGRA8 copy fallback [guess];
  multi-plane surfaces (b3a8) log their plane layout once and stay refused.
- host test: upload parameters and the fence table.

